WEBVTT

00:07:28.915 --> 00:07:30.580
to end our connection with my father

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:32.942
and start a new life.

00:07:32.942 --> 00:07:35.100
So why would I out myself

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:38.500
and potentially put myself in danger?

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:40.368
Well, that's simple.

00:07:40.368 --> 00:07:44.130
I do it in the hopes that perhaps someone someday

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:46.343
who is compelled to use violence

00:07:46.343 --> 00:07:48.704
may hear my story and realize

00:07:48.704 --> 00:07:51.201
that there is a better way,

00:07:51.201 --> 00:07:52.675
that although I had been subjected

00:07:52.675 --> 00:07:55.431
to this violent, intolerant ideology,

00:07:55.431 --> 00:07:57.920
that I did not become fanaticized.

00:07:57.920 --> 00:08:00.557
Instead, I choose to use my experience